sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as ASGI lifespan
    participant P as CvDataProvider
    participant G as cv GitHub Releases
    participant C as MCP client

    L->>L: load baked snapshot from image
    L->>P: construct with non-optional initial snapshot
    L-->>C: accepting requests (never blocked on network)
    L->>P: spawn refresh loop (15 min)

    P->>G: GET releases/latest/download/release.json
    G-->>P: tag + asset table
    alt tag differs from current snapshot
        P->>G: GET resume.yaml and resume-semantics.yaml
        P->>P: parse, build snapshot, atomic swap, state Fresh
    else tag unchanged
        P->>P: state Fresh, no further fetch
    end

    C->>P: get_cv(format=markdown)
    P-->>C: rendered in-process from the snapshot

    C->>P: get_cv(format=pdf)
    P->>G: GET CV pdf asset (lazy, cached by tag)
    G-->>C: base64 blob or ArtifactUnavailable with URL
